# An ability that triggers whenever a permanent "is tapped for mana" triggers when such a mana ability resolves and
# produces mana (CR 106.12a). Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth makes Gaea's Cradle a Forest, so Nissa, Who Shakes the World's
# "Whenever you tap a Forest for mana, add an additional {G}" would see it tapped; but with no creature on Bot1's side the
# Cradle's "{T}: Add {G} for each creature you control" produces nothing, and Nissa adds nothing: the pool stays empty
# (the Cradle, a Forest, could have tapped for {G} with the Forest's own ability instead, CR 305.6).
# The basic Forest tapped beside it, the control, makes {G}{G}. Nissa comes on turn 1 (the Forest and two Black Lotuses).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Black Lotus
Black Lotus
Nissa, Who Shakes the World
Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth
Gaea's Cradle
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Nissa, Who Shakes the World.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Yavimaya, Cradle of Growth.Play
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Gaea's Cradle.Play
? Bot1.Battlefield.Gaea's Cradle.Subtypes = Forest
Bot1.Battlefield.Gaea's Cradle.Activate(Ability: for each creature)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
? Bot1.Mana = {G}{G}

[Expect]
Turn = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Gaea's Cradle.Tapped = true
Bot1.Mana = {G}{G}
